        "explanation": "Immediate triage and handoff to the inpatient team with specific escalation criteria are provided.",
        "quote": "如果孩子现在有下面任何一种，请不要等：呼吸明显费力/喘得快、嘴唇发紫、精神很差叫不醒、持续高热不退、喝不进水或尿明显少，这种要立刻叫护士和医生来看。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00066",
        "explanation": "The model explains the separation of pathogens, lung findings, and treatment decisions without overreaching.",
        "quote": "“偏肺病毒”和“衣原体”是两类不同病原体。报告里如果都出现，可能是都检出，也可能是您把不同检查里的词看到一起了；即便都检出，也不等于每一个都一定是当前主要致病原因"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00086",
        "explanation": "The doctor reinforces the same monitoring plan across multiple turns, maintaining consistent safety messaging.",
        "quote": "继续按医嘱雾化和观察"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
        "explanation": "The model explicitly lists serious deterioration signs requiring immediate escalation.",
        "quote": "呼吸明显费力/喘得快、嘴唇发紫、精神很差叫不醒、持续高热不退、喝不进水或尿明显少"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00086",
        "explanation": "The model tailors the plan to the caregiver's expressed anxiety and the real-world nursing context.",
        "quote": "如果后面护士再来测，您可以直接问一句：“这次血氧多少？呼吸看起来稳不稳？”把数字记下来就很有帮助。"
      }
    ]
  },
