          "explanation": "The model assigns residual questions to the inpatient team and provides a bounded closure.",
          "quote": "接下来您最值得追问住院医生的，其实就两句：\n1. “孩子现在整体更像病毒为主，还是考虑合并细菌/衣原体感染？目前证据是什么？”\n2. “接下来什么情况算治疗无效或需要调整药物？您最看重哪几个指标？”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The model provided a handoff and residual questions for the inpatient team, but did not explicitly state which uncertainties are acceptable to carry forward or obtain caregiver receipt of the bounded closure.",
