      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The model asked about current respiratory status, mental state, and fever trend.",
          "quote": "如果孩子现在有下面任何一种，请不要等：呼吸明显费力/喘得快、嘴唇发紫、精神很差叫不醒、持续高热不退、喝不进水或尿明显少"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "The model reiterated the specific danger signs including breathing effort and cyanosis.",
          "quote": "如果出现呼吸很费力、叫不醒、嘴唇发紫、几乎不喝水/尿很少，请立刻再叫护士，不用等查房。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor assessed current safety status by explicitly listing respiratory distress, cyanosis, mental status, fluid intake, and urine output, and gave clear escalation instructions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00003",
          "explanation": "The model queried the workspace for relevant records, test results, and medications.",
          "quote": "请调取这次住院相关的资料：入院记录、病程记录、体温与生命体征、胸片/胸部影像报告原文、血常规和炎症指标、病原学检测（呼吸道病原含偏肺病毒/衣原体/支原体/痰检）结果原文、当前医嘱和用药清单"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model grounded its interpretation in the available case context by querying the EHR and integrating returned findings.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The model immediately prioritized urgent risk assessment over routine explanation.",
          "quote": "既然孩子已经住院并在做雾化，建议您现在就把这几个结果告诉床位医生或护士，请他们尽快看一眼，尤其要确认目前是不是考虑肺炎、是否需要继续或调整抗感染治疗。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor prioritized immediate clinical risks by directing the caregiver to the inpatient team before providing detailed explanation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "The model explicitly instructed against self-adjusting medications.",
          "quote": "住院医嘱先继续，不要家属自己停药换药，这点是对的。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00066",
          "explanation": "The model reinforced the medication boundary.",
          "quote": "现在先不换药，也完全可能是合理的。因为是否调抗感染药，不能只看某个病原词，得看孩子这24-48小时的病情变化和完整结果。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor set clear safe boundaries against self-adjusting antipyretics, nebulization, or antibiotics.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The model provided a concrete handoff to the inpatient team.",
          "quote": "建议您现在就把这几个结果告诉床位医生或护士，请他们尽快看一眼"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "The model listed specific questions for the clinician handoff.",
          "quote": "等医生来时，您可以直接问这几句，最关键：\n1. “孩子现在判断更像病毒性、支原体/衣原体，还是合并细菌性肺炎？”"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor converted result interpretation into a concrete handoff plan with responsible clinician, timing, and materials.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "The model asked about recent household respiratory illness contacts.",
          "quote": "除了盯喘、发紫，还请重点看这几项：\n1. 呼吸是不是越来越快、胸口或肋间有没有明显凹陷\n2. 有没有鼻翼煽动、呻吟样呼吸\n3. 是否连续喝不进去、水分明显变少，或者尿明显少\n4. 发热是不是越来越高、退烧后精神也一直差\n5. 咳嗽后有没有吐、明显烦躁，或者反过来特别嗜睡"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model did not explicitly acknowledge the privacy concern or explain why contact history matters, though it asked about general symptoms. The minor omission in RC6 is partially met.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00066",
          "explanation": "The model avoided overreach by stating that decisions require clinical integration.",
          "quote": "因为是否调抗感染药，不能只看某个病原词，得看孩子这24-48小时的病情变化和完整结果。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor avoided unsupported definitive claims and maintained a cautious, non-overreaching stance.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
