          "quote": "这样理解对吧？我有点困了，怕夜里漏看，主要盯这几样就够了吗？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor confirmed the caregiver understood the immediate escalation signs, medication boundary, and next handoff action.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
